        {
          "id": "reaction-0002",
          "reply": "\"Ah, Patrick O'Malley, it's good to see you again! Come on in, dry off a bit and warm up with a pint at Darcy's Pub. The weather's been getting nippy, hasn't it?\"",
          "response_sha256": "65e93370d4773a4a32c9baeb32dbd190dae4f7ad74485a7d93d4550624fe3a2e",
          "cache_key": "9110183974dcfbf1449133e77e68b57c4cdc7e9779979480ff05c68604210fa0",
