        {
          "id": "reaction-0003",
          "reply": "\"Ah, Father O'Malley, welcome! Come in, come in, the door's always open for a good man, especially on a Sunday like this. Let's grab a seat and warm up with a bit of a drink.\"",
          "response_sha256": "ca08baa3d54c3704ee6c603dd8d24ed708b62984279c5e99fdb07bb47cedb8ac",
          "cache_key": "e8595aa4d0f85567d3341022af7a1c31d1eda0577a5e24b4b338d75b11ca2ebf",
